ser-dynamic';\nimport { AppModule } from './app.module';\n\nplatformBrowserDynamic().bootstrapModule(AppModule).then((ref: ComponentRef) => {\n    enableDebugTools(ref);\n});\n```\n\nThen I get an `Uncaught TypeError: ng.probe is not a function` error in the console when Augury is enabled.\n\n![image](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/1104814/18990199/4c593698-8708-11e6-81aa-6a73f1ce7a18.png)\n\nDisabling Augury fixes the error.\n\nIt seems that Angular clobbers `window.ng` which means `window.ng.probe` is no longer available. I'm not sure if this is a bug in Angular - I'll report it now. Anyway perhaps Augury should check for the existence of `ng.probe`?\n\nUsing Angular v2.0.0\n\nhttps://github.com/angular/angular/issues/12002","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rangle/augury/issues/714/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rangle/augury/issues/714/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/250732897","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/12002#issuecomment-250732897","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/12002","id":250732897,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI1MDczMjg5Nw==","user":{"login":"danielcrisp","id":1104814,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDQ4MTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1104814?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielcrisp","html_url":"https://github.com/danielcrisp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielcrisp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielcrisp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielcrisp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielcrisp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"http